<h2 id="integration-acceptance">Integration acceptance</h2>

- Test observed and forecast periods, missing units or times and partial forecasts against the provider's model.
- Test a successful empty response, a failed one, an out-of-area warning and an expired warning one at a time.
- Check that every palette leaves the warning wording and credit unchanged, and that no severity is worked out from colour.

Record the environment, versions, state, method and result with [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a simulated example do not show real device behaviour, screen reader use or live compatibility. For calculated readings such as sun data and air quality, see [Specialist entities and derived information](specialist-entities.html#environment).
